  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 1702.49 Wetlands",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 1702.49 “Wetlands” means “wetlands” as defined in RSA 482-A:2, X, as reprinted in Appendix C. Wetlands include, but are not limited to, swamps, marshes, bogs, and similar areas as delineated in accordance with Env-Wt 100 et seq.\n\nSource. (See Revision Notes #1, #2, and #3 at chapter heading for Env-Wq 1700) #12042, eff 12-1-16; ss by #14203, eff 2-26-25 (formerly Env-Wq 1702.51)",
